decision_conditions:
The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and supporting documents and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: - drawing number PL011 dated 03/12/2022, Block Plan PL010 dated 24/09/20, Existing
Ground Floor Plan PL010 dated 29/10/20 and Proposed Ground Floor Plan PL001
undated &amp;amp; General Arrangement Level 00.&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The use hereby approved shall only operate between the hours
of:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Monday to Friday: 12:00 to 23:00, &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Saturday: 09:00 to 23:00&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Sunday and Bank Holidays: 11:00 to 21:00; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Use of the external ‘Yard’ area as shown on drawing General
Arrangement Level 00 for customers shall only be permitted between the hours as
follows: &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Monday to Saturday: 12.00 to 22:00&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Sunday and Bank Holidays: 12:00 to 21.00&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;No deliveries shall be taken to, or dispatched from, the
site other than between the hours of 09.00 and 20.00 Mondays to Saturdays, and
at no time on Sundays, Bank Holidays or Public Holidays.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
